WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Standing heavy punch punishes Juri’s recovery.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.450
Chun-Li enters Serenity Stream after the heavy punch.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.350
The medium-kick stance follow-up hits low.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.200
Heavy Spinning Bird Kick follows the stance kick.

5
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:04.600
Juri recovers after heavy SBK.
